{"id":"5172810efa76e7d3","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-myhill-operator.md","title":"Myhill's Operator Theorem","display":"thm-myhill-operator — Myhill's Operator Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-myhill-operator","aliases":["90-thm-myhill-operator"],"display":"thm-myhill-operator — Myhill's Operator Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-creative-set]]","[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-myhill-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-myhill-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-myhill-operator — Myhill's Operator Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1316be710802d6a1\" href=\"?note=1316be710802d6a1\" title=\"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> 的固定编号完全相同；结论中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 是存在量化的变量，不是假设先已给出的见证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (creative set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> (creative-set predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (effective enumeration of c.e. sets)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Theta:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total recursive productive function)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}operator}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\Theta\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\nW_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus C\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Theta(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus C)\\setminus W_e\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}operator}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\Theta\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\nW_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus C\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Theta(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus C)\\setminus W_e\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\\)</span>，取其中存在的全递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta=p\">\\(\\Theta=p\\)</span>。其余量词及条件恰为该定义的生产性合取项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生产力函数作用于 c.e. 集的索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，不是直接把集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 当作可计算输入。</li>\n<li>生产性属于创造集的补集：前提和结论都必须位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\setminus C\">\\(\\mathbb N\\setminus C\\)</span> 一侧。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 的直接来源是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>，而不是只定义谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> 的底层文件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>保留原文实际陈述的生产函数见证命题；本文件名虽使用 Myhill 名称，不能据此擅自替换为递归同构定理或其它算子定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"40041a5a5d6a4573","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"1316be710802d6a1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e$ 直接取 [[90-df-program-numbering]]，与 $\\mathrm{Creative}$ 的固定编号完全相同；结论中的 $\\Theta$ 是存在量化的变量，不是假设先已给出的见证。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"40041a5a5d6a4573","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (creative set, see [[90-df-creative-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 的直接来源是 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]，而不是只定义谓词 $\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 的底层文件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}operator}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\Theta\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\nW_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus C\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Theta(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus C)\\setminus W_e\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta=p","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\setminus C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false}],"bytes":1840,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md]]\n[[90-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md]]\n[[90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md]]\n[[90-thm-min-closure-rec.md]]\n[[90-thm-myhill-operator.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursion-theorem.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md]]\n[[90-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]"}],"outgoing":["40041a5a5d6a4573","1316be710802d6a1","137d75d038de4a47","5d66bf24ea0c6e5a"]}